<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1059_3313.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Min <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündtlich</unclear> willig dienst, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gruoß</unclear> unnd alles guots
